 "notes": "Visionaries is listed apart from the existing investors (Anthemis, Connect, Mouro, Northzone, Temasek) in the Series D, so D is the entry. The $700M figure is Bloomberg (via Yahoo, 2024-10-04) citing a person familiar with the $50M Series E extension led by Northzone; it replaces the 2021 Series E '>$1B post-money' mark. Siblings carry below_1b with the same Yahoo citation; this adds the figure. The eBay strategic investment (Feb 2026) has no disclosed amount or valuation. TrueLayer bought Zimpler (announced Oct 2025) and in3 (May/Jun 2026); it remains private. Series C amount: businesscloud headline says GBP 19.5M; BeBeez gives USD 25M (Oct 2020)."
